        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A journey through a cosmic tunnel where neon cubes float toward you. Your mission is simple: steer through the tunnel, avoid collisions, and collect special cubes to rack up points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, the pace increases — the tunnel accelerates, obstacles come faster, and reflexes become key. Each run challenges you to beat your previous score. The visuals shift over time, with changing color palettes and lighting that refresh the atmosphere.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric space-themed environment with neon lighting and dynamic color shifts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reflex-based gameplay: dodge incoming cubes and collect bonus cubes for higher scores.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gradually increasing speed and challenge — the longer you last, the more intense the run becomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual variety: periodic changes in color themes keep each session visually engaging.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist and stylized geometric design that matches the cosmic setting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive ambient/electronic soundtrack to complement the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you want a quick reflex challenge or a relaxed but engaging cosmic ride — [Your Game Name] offers a balanced blend of immersion, challenge, and visual style.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A journey through a cosmic tunnel where neon cubes float toward you. Your mission is simple: steer through the tunnel, avoid collisions, and collect special cubes to rack up points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, the pace increases — the tunnel accelerates, obstacles come faster, and reflexes become key. Each run challenges you to beat your previous score. The visuals shift over time, with changing color palettes and lighting that refresh the atmosphere.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric space-themed environment with neon lighting and dynamic color shifts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reflex-based gameplay: dodge incoming cubes and collect bonus cubes for higher scores.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gradually increasing speed and challenge — the longer you last, the more intense the run becomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual variety: periodic changes in color themes keep each session visually engaging.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist and stylized geometric design that matches the cosmic setting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive ambient/electronic soundtrack to complement the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you want a quick reflex challenge or a relaxed but engaging cosmic ride — [Your Game Name] offers a balanced blend of immersion, challenge, and visual style.</p>",
